  "introduction": [
    "Drawing on the arcane knowledge within the dragon soul, the echoing voice imbues their magic with the full force of a dragon’s wrath. They are the most knowledgeable in terms of arcane power, and are able to produce more spells than any other dragoneer. They can shape spells into a ferocious draconic variant of themselves to strike others by commanding the magic itself in the voice of dragonkind."
